-- The table also pairs (31, 19) and (33, 21): the test reads rows other than the one for the previous cell 20. It prints 29 against two previous cells, (2)18 and 20.
#ASSERT `the table prints the new cell against the previous cell` `the comparison table of NH 18 as the row types it` "31" "19"
#ASSERT `the table prints the new cell against the previous cell` `the comparison table of NH 18 as the row types it` "33" "21"
