#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 978 section 2(a)`)'s `the next subsection as a string, not evaluated` EQUALS "אין בהוראות סעיף קטן (א) כדי לפגוע במשפט שנקלט בארץ לפני תחילת חוק זה."
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 978 section 2(a)`)'s `the commencement the pages read print` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`the instruction of SH 978 section 2(a)`)'s `the place in the instrument` EQUALS "section 2(א)"
#ASSERT (`the citing words of item I3`)'s `the number the citing words give` EQUALS "46"
#ASSERT (`the citing words of item I3`)'s `the place in the Law` EQUALS "section 160"
