#ASSERT `Sefer HaChukim 3238`'s `its title as a deposited page prints it` EQUALS JUST "חוק התקשורת (בזק ושידורים) (תיקון מס׳ 78), התשפ״ד–2024"
#ASSERT NOT (`the title of the instrument contains the string` `Sefer HaChukim 1634` `the part of the title SH 3238 prints that names the law as the Communications Law`)

-- The three steps are applied in issue-date order, 1997, 2001, 2024, and the dates are the ones the footers print.
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued before the second` `Sefer HaChukim 1634` `Sefer HaChukim 1807`
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued before the second` `Sefer HaChukim 1807` `Sefer HaChukim 3238`
